      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romeville%2C_Louisiana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community sits on the Mississippi River alluvial plain, a flat, fertile landscape that shaped its agricultural roots.",
